<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμῠδις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Aeol.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμα</span>
			, Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.281
			</span></i> H.: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of Time,
				<i>together, at the same time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.415
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				345
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> more
			freq. of Place, <i>all together,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. κικλήσκετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.300
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. στήσασα</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλέσασα</span>
			)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.114
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.336
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστέα . . πάντ᾽ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.385
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. φλόγ᾽ ἔβαλλον</span> threw
			burning embers <i>together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				23.217
			</span></i>; freq. in late 
				Ep.
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.961
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				581
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
